---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="社會服務｜王雅萍 Ong Nga Ping"
  description="國立政治大學王雅萍副教授社會服務、公共參與與地方實踐"
>
  <main class="page">

    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">SOCIAL SERVICE</p>

      <h1>
        <span data-lang="zh">社會服務</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Social Service</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        <span data-lang="zh">
          本頁整理王雅萍副教授歷年參與之學術服務、
          大學社會責任、地方合作、社區實踐與公共服務。
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          This page presents Ong Nga Ping's academic service,
          university social responsibility, community engagement,
          local collaboration, and public service.
        </span>
      </p>
    </header>


    <!-- 大學與學術服務 -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">
        UNIVERSITY & ACADEMIC SERVICE
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          大學與學術服務
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          University & Academic Service
        </span>
      </h2>

      <div class="service-list">

        <article class="service-item">
          <span class="number">01</span>

          <div>
            <h3>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                校務與學術行政服務
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                University & Academic Administration
              </span>
            </h3>

            <p>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                整理歷年於國立政治大學及相關學術單位
                所參與之行政、學術與公共服務。
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                University administration, academic service,
                and institutional engagement at National Chengchi University
                and related academic organizations.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>


        <article class="service-item">
          <span class="number">02</span>

          <div>
            <h3>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                民族與原住民族教育服務
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                Ethnic & Indigenous Education Service
              </span>
            </h3>

            <p>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                整理與原住民族教育、族語教育、
                課程發展及教育推廣相關之公共服務。
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                Public service related to Indigenous education,
                Indigenous languages, curriculum development,
                and educational outreach.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 社區與地方 -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">
        COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          社區與地方實踐
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Community Engagement
        </span>
      </h2>

      <div class="service-list">

        <article class="service-item">
          <span class="number">03</span>

          <div>
            <h3>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                社區合作與地方實踐
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                Community Collaboration & Local Practice
              </span>
            </h3>

            <p>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                整理與地方社區、原住民族部落、
                文化傳承及社區發展相關之合作與服務。
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                Collaboration with local communities and Indigenous
                communities in cultural transmission and community development.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>


        <article class="service-item">
          <span class="number">04</span>

          <div>
            <h3>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                大學社會責任與公共參與
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                University Social Responsibility & Public Engagement
              </span>
            </h3>

            <p>
              <span data-lang="zh">
                整理大學社會責任、地方創生、
                社會實踐與跨領域合作相關活動。
              </span>

              <span data-lang="en">
                University social responsibility, placemaking,
                social practice, and interdisciplinary public engagement.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 資料說明 -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">
        RECORDS
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          服務紀錄
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Service Records
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p class="note">
        <span data-lang="zh">
          詳細歷年服務項目將依國立政治大學官方資料、
          學術履歷及相關計畫紀錄整理更新。
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Detailed records will be updated based on official NCCU
          information, academic records, and related project documentation.
        </span>
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .page {
    width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 100px 0 130px;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 850px;
    padding-bottom: 90px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    margin: 0 0 14px;

    color: var(--brown);

    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text);

    font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 88px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 780px;

    margin: 36px 0 0;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  section {
    padding: 64px 0;

    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 42px;

    color: var(--text);

    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 40px);
  }

  .service-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .service-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;

    gap: 28px;

    padding: 32px 0;

    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .number {
    color: var(--brown);

    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .service-item h3 {
    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text);

    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .service-item p,
  .note {
    max-width: 760px;

    margin: 13px 0 0;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);

      padding: 60px 0 80px;
    }

    .page-header {
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 45px 0;
    }

    .service-item {
      grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;

      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>